  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities, separating sensing (uncontrollable events) from motion (controllable events). The specification automata enforce safe obstacle avoidance, recovery, and forward-biased exploration, ensuring that obstacle recovery is conservative and that the robot returns to exploration as soon as possible. Recovery actions are brief and escalate only if repeated blockages occur.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion, with a combined plant for simplicity.",
    "Specification automata enforce safe transitions, conservative recovery, and strong bias toward forward/random_walk exploration, using helper states for recovery and last-resort actions."
